  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "286",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解释下列各题的含义：",
        "1) 温度变化了 $t^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$，设 $t=28$，$-30$，$-8$，$4.5$，$-20$，",
        "$-1.7$.",
        "2) 弹簧的长度变化了 $p$ 毫米，设 $p=15$，$-10$，$12$，$-9$，",
        "$-4$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "287",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "气温变化了 $x$ 度. 设气温：",
        "1) 降低 $6^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$；　　　　　3) 升高 $60^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$；",
        "2) 升高 $3.6^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$；　　　　4) 降低 $35.8^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$，",
        "$x$ 为多少度？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "288",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "弹簧的长度变化了 $n$ 毫米. 设弹簧长度：",
        "1) 延长 6 毫米；　　　　　3) 缩短 23 毫米；",
        "2) 缩短 5 毫米；　　　　　4) 延长 18 毫米，",
        "$n$ 等于几？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "289",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "上午温度变化 $6^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$，下午变化 $-4^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$，这一天内温度是怎",
        "样变化的？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "290",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在数轴上标出点 $A(7)$. 如果把 7 移动 2，这个点将移到",
        "哪里？如果 7 移动 $-3$ 时，这个点又将移到哪里？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "291",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当 $-4$ 移动 6 时，点 $A(-4)$ 将移到哪里？又当 $-4$ 移动",
        "$-7$ 时，这点又将移到哪里？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "292",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "说出 $A(2,7)$，$B(-3,-6)$，$C(4,-5)$，$E(0,6)$ 各点关于",
        "坐标原点 $O$ 的对称点的坐标."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "293",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设 $A(-6,2)$，$B(-2,2)$，$C(-1,5)$，$D(-4,5)$，作四边",
        "形 $ABCD$ 的关于坐标原点的对称四边形."
      ]
    },
